    "intro": {
      "type": "chasseur-cast-iron-intro",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "LA MAISON CHASSEUR",
        "heading": "Chasseur cast iron day-to-day",
        "body": "<p>Chasseur have been crafting its famous cast-iron casseroles and cast-iron cookware in its foundry in the Champagne Ardennes region of France, established in 1924. Chasseur continues to honour its traditional techniques to this day — producing cast-iron cookware in individual sand moulds and spray painting the enamel coatings by hand — making each piece unique.</p>",
        "background_color": "#F2EFEB",
        "background_image_opacity": 50,
        "eyebrow_color": "#44362B",
        "heading_color": "#1B1918",
        "body_color": "#44362B",
        "padding_top": 52,
        "padding_bottom": 52,
        "padding_top_mobile": 32,
        "padding_bottom_mobile": 32
      }
    },
    "benefits": {
      "type": "chasseur-benefits-split",
      "blocks": {
        "b1": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "Heat Retention",
            "heading": "Dishes stay hot at the table",
            "body": "<p>Enamelled cast iron warms gradually, accumulates heat evenly, and retains it for a long time — so meals arrive perfectly warm and stay that way throughout dinner.</p>",
            "image_position": "right",
            "panel_color": "#353131",
            "gradient_color": "#DED6CC",
            "eyebrow_color": "#FFFFFF",
            "heading_color": "#FFFFFF",
            "body_color": "#E3E3E3"
          }
        },
        "b2": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "Moisture Lock",
            "heading": "Moist and delicious cooking",
            "body": "<p>Enamelled cast iron is perfect for grilling, sautéing, roasting... and stewing. After the food has been braised, the water vapour from the stew condenses upon contact with the cooler lid and forms droplets. These droplets then proceed to evenly and continuously baste the food thanks to the ridges inside the lid.</p>",
            "image_position": "left",
            "panel_color": "#353131",
            "gradient_color": "#DED6CC",
            "eyebrow_color": "#FFFFFF",
            "heading_color": "#FFFFFF",
            "body_color": "#E3E3E3"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["b1", "b2"],
      "settings": {
        "padding_top": 80,
