          "settings": {
            "title": "Greek Easter Bread - Tsoureki",
            "excerpt": "This Tsoureki is a Traditional Greek Sweet Yeast Bread that represents the Holy Trinity through the three-part braid of the bread. Include decorated hard-boiled eggs to decorate!",
